UID:cvs-seminar-salem-20260622
DTSTART:20260622T120000
DTEND:20260622T130000
SUMMARY:CVS Seminar: Non-animal models to study regenerative medicine for diabetes
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Prof Victoria Salem (King's College London). Title: Non-animal models to study regenerative medicine for diabetes.\nHost: Ahmad Al-Mrabeh.\nShort Bio: Vicky Salem is the RD Lawrence Professor of Diabetic Medicine at King's College London. Her lab explores immunomodulatory scaffolds for beta cell transplantation and non-animal models of pancreatic islet biology.\nSocial: Pizza in The Larder 13:00-13:30.
LOCATION:Wellcome Theatre, QMRI
STATUS:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
