DTEND:20260624T130000
SUMMARY:CIR Seminar: Critical Roles of Nerve and Airway Associated Interstitial Macrophages (NAMs) in Respiratory Immunity
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Prof Kamal Khanna (NYU School of Medicine). Title: Critical Roles of Nerve and Airway Associated Interstitial Macrophages (NAMs) in Respiratory Immunity: Balancing Immunity, Disease Tolerance, and Inflammation.\nHost: Professor Chris Lucas.
