SUMMARY:Clinical Genomes Scotland
DESCRIPTION:Forum on implementing clinical genomics in Scottish healthcare.\nTopics: genome sequencing technology in healthcare, genome-based patient care, genomic data and IT systems, innovation pathways.\nRegistration free for University researchers, NHS staff, patients and patient groups.\nProgramme: https://onehealthgenomics.ed.ac.uk/clinical.genomes.scotland
